s Bluetooth v5.3 architecture for ultra-stable wireless streaming with minimized latency. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>For analog and legacy media sources, the device is equipped with direct hardware ports supporting AUX, USB flash drives, and TF/MicroSD memory cards, alongside an integrated FM tuner. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Furthermore, the unit supports advanced True Wireless Stereo (TWS) pairing, enabling users to wirelessly couple two independent Boom Flash units to deploy a authentic, dual-channel left-and-right stereo soundstage.</li></ol>','Boost your entertainment with SnapUp Boom Flash—rich stereo sound, dynamic RGB lights, seamless Bluetooth connectivity, and long-lasting playtime.','<p>SnapUp is a dynamic lifestyle brand focused on delivering smart, stylish, and value-driven products for everyday use. Blending modern technology with practical design, the brand caters to consumers who seek convenience, performance, and affordability in one place.</p><p><br></p>','approved',0,1,1,'','2026-04-15 12:10:10',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0,0,'standard',0),(271,18,1,3,11,'SnapUp','SnapUp','Boom Max',18.00,'85182900',1,1,1,7,3,7,'standard','<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>The <strong>SnapUp Boom Max</strong> is a high-performance, home-theater-style wireless soundbar engineered to deliver a rich, immersive audio experience. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Designed as a comprehensive acoustic upgrade for home entertainment setups, this premium soundbar integrates dual 52mm dynamic drivers that produce a bold 40W surround output. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Finely calibrated with proprietary Supreme HD Bass technology, it introduces deep, thumping low-end response while maintaining precise acoustic balan