ional sports gear, making outdoor play more engaging for children.</p>','pending',1,1,1,NULL,'2026-04-18 05:11:02',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0,0,'standard',0),(339,18,21,95,NULL,'Early Learning Centre','Early Learning Centre','ELC Popping Plane Vehicle ',12.00,'95030040',1,1,1,7,3,7,'standard','<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 17, 17);\">Active &amp; engaging play: pulling the plane pops colorful balls and turns the propeller with a satisfying click, encouraging walking, balance, and spatial awareness.</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 17, 17);\">Sensory &amp; skill growth: soft-touch materials and rattle sounds stimulate senses while boosting fine motor skills, hand-eye coordination, and curiosity.</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 17, 17);\">Safe &amp; child-friendly: crafted from non-toxic, bpa-free, eco-friendly materials with smooth edges for worry-free, toddler-safe fun.</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 17, 17);\">Portable design: lightweight and compact for indoor and outdoor adventures—take it to the garden, park, or backyard easily.</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(15, 17, 17);\">Perfect gift choice: bright colors, interactive sounds, and a charming aesthetic make it an ideal gift for birthdays and special occasions.</span></li></ol>','Fuel early steps with this fun pull-along plane! As it moves, balls pop inside and the propeller clicks, keeping your toddler active.','<p>Early Learning Centre (ELC) is a globally recognized children’s toy brand known for creating educational, safe, and development-focused toys for infants and young children. Founded in the United Kingdom, the brand has built a strong reputation for designing products that support early childhood development through play.</p><p><br></p>','approved',0,1,1,'','2026-04-18 05:32:27',NULL,NULL,'Construction Toy',0.0,0,'standard',0),(340,18,21,95,NULL,'Early Learning Centre','Early Learning Centre','Build and Play Car',12.00,'95030040',1,1,1,7,3,7,'standard','<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Dynamic STEM build-and-play car champions early problem-solving. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Easy-to-snap shapes hone fine motor skills and unleash boundless imagination.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Vibrant take-apart toy car sparks intellectual growth. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>An ideal birthday gift featuring effortless assembly to captivate and educate young minds.</li></ol>','Inspire endless creativity with colorful, easy-snap bricks. Kids build skyscrapers, vehicles, and dream realms while boosting brainpower.','<p>Early learning centre (elc) is a globally recognized children’s toy brand known for creating educational, safe, and development-focused toys for infants and young children. Founded in the United Kingdom, the brand has built a strong reputation for designing products that support early childhood development through play.</p><p><br></p>','approved',0,1,1,'','2026-04-18 05:40:13',NULL,NULL,NULL,0.0,0,'standard',0),(341,18,21,95,NULL,'Early Learning Centre','Hamleys India','Tambourine',12.00,'95030030',1,1,1,7,3,7,'standard','<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>The early learning centre (elc) my little