ntenteditable=\"false\"></span>Perfect for fitness enthusiasts and everyday use, it combines supportive comfort, flexibility, and practical convenience.</li></ol>','Move with confidence in frido’s knee support wrap, featuring breathable comfort, adjustable compression and ergonomic kneecap support.','<p>Frido creates innovative, ergonomic solutions designed to enhance everyday comfort, safety and well-being through thoughtful, research-backed products.</p>','pending',0,1,1,NULL,'2026-11-25 12:18:19',NULL,NULL,' Knee Support Wrap',0.0,0,'standard',0),(1745,40,7,90,NULL,'Frido','Arcatron Mobility Pvt Ltd','Men\'s Cloud Comfort Shoes Lace Ups',18.00,'64061010',1,0,1,4,5,7,'standard','<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Experience the perfect blend of modern elegance and exceptional comfort with frido men\'s cloud comfort shoes 2.0, thoughtfully crafted for effortless everyday movement. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Featuring a spacious natural toe box, these shoes offer freedom of movement and a relaxed walking experience. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>The innovative zero-drop sole promotes natural foot alignment, while built-in arch support provides enhanced cushioning and stability. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Designed with a breathable mesh upper and secure lace-up closure, they deliver lightweight comfort and a personalized fit. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Finished in sophisticated navy blue, these versatile shoes complement every casual look, making them an ideal choice for walking, commuting, travelling, and all-day wear.</li></ol>','Step into effortless style and luxurious comfort with breathable mesh, natural toe freedom, supportive cushioning and a sleek, elegant design.','<p>Frido creates innovative, ergonomic solutions designed to enhance everyday comfort, safety and well-being through thoughtful, research-backed products.</p>','pending',0,1,1,NULL,'2026-11-26 05:23:53',NULL,NULL,'Shoes',0.0,0,'standard',0),(1746,40,27,142,NULL,'Frido','Arcatron Mobility Pvt Ltd',' Max Comfort Arch Cushion Insole',18.00,'64061010',1,0,1,4,5,7,'standard','<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Experience exceptional foot comfort with premium arch cushioning, thoughtfully designed to provide superior support and stability throughout the day. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Advanced Hi-Per Foam technology delivers responsive cushioning to key pressure zones, ensuring balanced comfort with every step. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>The ergonomic deep heel cup gently cradles your heel for enhanced stability and natural foot alignment. </li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Innovative shock-absorbing technology helps distribute pressure evenly for smoother, more comfortable movement.</li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span>Featuring a convenient trim-to-fit design, these versatile insoles offer personalized comfort for walking, sports, office wear, and everyday activities.</li></ol>','Elevate every step with premium arch support, plush hi-per foam cushioning, enhanced heel stability and exceptional all-day comfort.','<p>Frido creates innovative, ergonomic solutions designed to enhance everyday comfort, safety and well-being through thoughtful, research-backed products.</p>','pending',0,1,1,NULL,'2026-11-26 06:08:30',NULL,NULL,'Insole',0.0,0,'standard',0),(1747,40,7,90,NULL,'Frido','Arcatron Mobility Pvt Ltd','Men\'s Dual Strap Comfort Sandal',18.00,'64059000',1,0,1,4,5,7,'standard','<ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" cont